{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "4fddb3b0-d29b-4714-a462-d1804a6d4c94",
    "name": "Grupo 02 - Transferencias entre Cuentas",
    "description": "Colección API para Transferencias entre Cuentas (Grupo 02).\n\n**Datos dinámicos (SQL Sandbox)**\nCada escenario consulta la BD con `POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sql/select` ([docs](https://aiquaa-sandbox-api.vercel.app/docs#tag/sql-sandbox/POST/api/v1/sql/select)) antes de transferir. Body: `{ \"sql\": \"... $1\", \"params\": [...] }`.\n\nNo hace falta cargar IDs a mano: el pre-request elige cuentas, saldos y montos reales.\n\n**Escenarios**\n1. Happy path\n2. Saldo insuficiente\n3. Monto exacto (vacía una cuenta chica)\n4. Destino bloqueado/inactivo\n5. Misma cuenta origen/destino\n6. Monto 0 y negativo\n\nEl folder **00 - SQL Sandbox** deja ver las queries y también llena variables si lo corrés primero.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "33454173"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - SQL Sandbox (datos dinámicos)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "SQL - Cuentas activas con saldo",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const rows = utils.rows(pm.response);",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('SQL REST respondió 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('data/rows es un arreglo con al menos 2 cuentas activas', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(rows).to.be.an('array').that.has.length.of.at.least(2);",
                  "    pm.expect(rows[0]).to.include.keys('id', 'saldo');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (rows.length >= 2) {",
                  "    utils.applyCuentas(rows[0], rows[1]);",
                  "    const saldo = Number(rows[0].saldo);",
                  "    const monto = Math.max(1, Math.min(1000, Math.floor(saldo / 10) || 1));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('montoValido', String(monto));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('montoMayorAlSaldo', String(saldo + 50000));",
                  "    console.log('SQL fixture activas | origen=', rows[0].id, 'destino=', rows[1].id, 'monto=', monto);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sql\": \"SELECT id, saldo, activa FROM cuentas WHERE activa = true AND saldo > 0 ORDER BY saldo DESC LIMIT 2\",\n  \"params\": []\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sql/select",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "sql", "select"]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene las 2 cuentas activas con más saldo y setea `cuentaOrigenId`, `cuentaDestinoId` y `montoValido`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "SQL - Cuenta inactiva / bloqueada",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const rows = utils.rows(pm.response);",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('SQL REST respondió 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Hay al menos una cuenta inactiva', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(rows).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (rows[0]) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('cuentaBloqueadaId', String(rows[0].id));",
                  "    console.log('SQL fixture inactiva | id=', rows[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sql\": \"SELECT id, saldo, activa FROM cuentas WHERE activa = false LIMIT 1\",\n  \"params\": []\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sql/select",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "sql", "select"]
            },
            "description": "Busca una cuenta `activa = false` y setea `cuentaBloqueadaId`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "SQL - COUNT transferencias",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const rows = utils.rows(pm.response);",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('SQL REST respondió 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve total de transferencias', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(rows[0]).to.have.property('total');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.variables.set('totalAntes', String(rows[0] ? rows[0].total : 0));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('totalTransferenciasSetup', String(rows[0] ? rows[0].total : 0));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sql\": \"SELECT COUNT(*) AS total FROM transferencias\",\n  \"params\": []\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sql/select",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "sql", "select"]
            },
            "description": "Baseline de filas en `transferencias` para asserts de no-inserción."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Queries explícitas a SQL Sandbox. Los escenarios 1-6 vuelven a consultar solos en el pre-request, así que este folder es opcional para inspeccionar datos."
    },
    {
      "name": "Escenario 1 - Happy Path (Transferencia exitosa)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST transferencia exitosa entre cuentas activas",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "return utils.prepareEscenario('happy');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const origenId = pm.collectionVariables.get('cuentaOrigenId');",
                  "const destinoId = pm.collectionVariables.get('cuentaDestinoId');",
                  "const monto = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('montoValido'));",
                  "const saldoOrigenAntes = Number(pm.variables.get('saldoOrigenAntes'));",
                  "const saldoDestinoAntes = Number(pm.variables.get('saldoDestinoAntes'));",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code indica creación exitosa (200 o 201)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Content-Type es JSON', function () {",
                  "    const ct = pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '';",
                  "    pm.expect(ct.toLowerCase()).to.include('application/json');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "const data = jsonData.data || jsonData;",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('La respuesta incluye un id de transferencia', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('transferenciaId', String(data.id));",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('El monto transferido coincide con lo solicitado', function () {",
                  "    if (data.monto !== undefined) {",
                  "        pm.expect(Number(data.monto)).to.eql(monto);",
                  "    }",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Origen y destino coinciden con lo enviado', function () {",
                  "    const o = data.cuentaOrigenId || data.cuenta_origen_id;",
                  "    const d = data.cuentaDestinoId || data.cuenta_destino_id;",
                  "    if (o !== undefined) pm.expect(String(o)).to.eql(String(origenId));",
                  "    if (d !== undefined) pm.expect(String(d)).to.eql(String(destinoId));",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response time is less than 3000ms', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(3000);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "utils.assertNuevaTransferencia();",
                  "utils.assertSaldosMovidos(origenId, destinoId, monto);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cuentaOrigenId\": {{cuentaOrigenId}},\n  \"cuentaDestinoId\": {{cuentaDestinoId}},\n  \"monto\": {{montoValido}},\n  \"descripcion\": \"Happy path - transferencia exitosa\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transferencias",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "transferencias"]
            },
            "description": "Pre-request SQL: 2 cuentas activas con saldo. Monto = min(1000, 10% del saldo) para no vaciar el origen."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET verificar transferencia creada",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const id = pm.collectionVariables.get('transferenciaId');",
                  "if (!id) {",
                  "    throw new Error('No hay transferenciaId. Corré primero el POST del escenario 1.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code es 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "const data = jsonData.data || jsonData;",
                  "const esperado = String(pm.collectionVariables.get('transferenciaId'));",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('La transferencia consultada corresponde al id creado', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(String(data.id)).to.eql(esperado);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('La transferencia no está rechazada', function () {",
                  "    if (data.activo !== undefined) pm.expect(Boolean(data.activo)).to.eql(true);",
                  "    if (data.estado !== undefined) pm.expect(String(data.estado).toLowerCase()).to.not.eql('rechazada');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('El monto consultado coincide con el enviado', function () {",
                  "    if (data.monto !== undefined) {",
                  "        pm.expect(Number(data.monto)).to.eql(Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('montoValido')));",
                  "    }",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "utils.sql('SELECT id, monto FROM transferencias WHERE id = $1', [Number(esperado)]).then(function (rows) {",
                  "    pm.test('SQL: la transferencia existe en BD con el mismo id', function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(rows).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
                  "        pm.expect(String(rows[0].id)).to.eql(esperado);",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transferencias/{{transferenciaId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "transferencias", "{{transferenciaId}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Transferencia interna exitosa. Cuentas y monto salen de SQL Sandbox en el pre-request."
    },
    {
      "name": "Escenario 2 - Negativo (Saldo insuficiente)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST transferencia con monto mayor al saldo disponible",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "return utils.prepareEscenario('insufficient');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const origenId = pm.collectionVariables.get('cuentaOrigenId');",
                  "const destinoId = pm.collectionVariables.get('cuentaDestinoId');",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code indica error de validación (400 o 422)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([400, 422]);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('El mensaje de error menciona saldo insuficiente', function () {",
                  "    const mensaje = JSON.stringify(pm.response.json()).toLowerCase();",
                  "    pm.expect(mensaje).to.match(/insuficiente|saldo/);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('No se devuelve id de transferencia creada', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const data = body.data || {};",
                  "    pm.expect(data.id, 'no debe crear transferencia').to.not.be.ok;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response time is less than 3000ms', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(3000);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "utils.assertNoNuevaTransferencia();",
                  "utils.assertSaldosSinCambio(origenId, destinoId);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cuentaOrigenId\": {{cuentaOrigenId}},\n  \"cuentaDestinoId\": {{cuentaDestinoId}},\n  \"monto\": {{montoMayorAlSaldo}},\n  \"descripcion\": \"Rechazo por saldo insuficiente\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transferencias",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "transferencias"]
            },
            "description": "SQL lee el saldo real del origen y envía saldo + 50000."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Rechazo por saldo insuficiente. El monto se calcula contra el saldo actual en BD."
    },
    {
      "name": "Escenario 3 - Edge Case (Monto exacto del saldo)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST transferencia por el 100% del saldo disponible",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "return utils.prepareEscenario('exact');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const origenId = pm.collectionVariables.get('cuentaOrigenId');",
                  "const destinoId = pm.collectionVariables.get('cuentaDestinoId');",
                  "const montoExacto = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('montoExacto'));",
                  "const saldoDestinoAntes = Number(pm.variables.get('saldoDestinoAntes'));",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code indica creación exitosa (200 o 201)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "const data = jsonData.data || jsonData;",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Se creó una transferencia con el monto exacto del saldo', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    if (data.monto !== undefined) pm.expect(Number(data.monto)).to.eql(montoExacto);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Si la API informa saldo origen resultante, es 0', function () {",
                  "    const restante = data.saldo_origen_resultante !== undefined ? data.saldo_origen_resultante : data.saldoOrigenResultante;",
                  "    if (restante !== undefined) pm.expect(Number(restante)).to.eql(0);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response time is less than 3000ms', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(3000);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "utils.sql('SELECT id, saldo FROM cuentas WHERE id IN ($1, $2)', [Number(origenId), Number(destinoId)]).then(function (rows) {",
                  "    pm.test('SQL: origen queda en 0 y destino aumenta el saldo exacto', function () {",
                  "        const origen = rows.find(function (r) { return String(r.id) === String(origenId); });",
                  "        const destino = rows.find(function (r) { return String(r.id) === String(destinoId); });",
                  "        pm.expect(Number(origen.saldo)).to.eql(0);",
                  "        pm.expect(Number(destino.saldo)).to.eql(saldoDestinoAntes + montoExacto);",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cuentaOrigenId\": {{cuentaOrigenId}},\n  \"cuentaDestinoId\": {{cuentaDestinoId}},\n  \"monto\": {{montoExacto}},\n  \"descripcion\": \"Transferencia por el 100% del saldo\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transferencias",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "transferencias"]
            },
            "description": "SQL elige la cuenta activa con menor saldo > 0 y transfiere ese saldo exacto (`montoExacto`)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Edge: vacía una cuenta chica (no la de mayor saldo) para no romper el resto del runner."
    },
    {
      "name": "Escenario 4 - Negativo (Cuenta destino bloqueada)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST transferencia hacia cuenta bloqueada",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "return utils.prepareEscenario('blocked');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const origenId = pm.collectionVariables.get('cuentaOrigenId');",
                  "const destinoId = pm.collectionVariables.get('cuentaBloqueadaId');",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code indica error (400, 403 o 422)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([400, 403, 422]);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('El mensaje menciona cuenta bloqueada o inactiva', function () {",
                  "    const mensaje = JSON.stringify(pm.response.json()).toLowerCase();",
                  "    const ok = mensaje.includes('bloquead') || mensaje.includes('inactiv') || mensaje.includes('habilit') || mensaje.includes('activa');",
                  "    pm.expect(ok, 'el error debe explicar que el destino no está habilitado').to.be.true;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('No se devuelve id de transferencia creada', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const data = body.data || {};",
                  "    pm.expect(data.id, 'no debe crear transferencia').to.not.be.ok;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "utils.assertNoNuevaTransferencia();",
                  "utils.assertSaldosSinCambio(origenId, destinoId);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cuentaOrigenId\": {{cuentaOrigenId}},\n  \"cuentaDestinoId\": {{cuentaBloqueadaId}},\n  \"monto\": {{montoValido}},\n  \"descripcion\": \"Rechazo por destino bloqueado\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transferencias",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "transferencias"]
            },
            "description": "SQL busca origen activo y destino `activa = false`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Rechazo hacia cuenta inactiva/bloqueada obtenida por SQL."
    },
    {
      "name": "Escenario 5 - Negativo (Misma cuenta origen y destino)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST transferencia hacia la misma cuenta",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "return utils.prepareEscenario('same_account');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const origenId = pm.collectionVariables.get('cuentaOrigenId');",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code indica error de validación (400 o 422)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([400, 422]);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('El mensaje indica que origen y destino no pueden ser iguales', function () {",
                  "    const mensaje = JSON.stringify(pm.response.json()).toLowerCase();",
                  "    const ok = mensaje.includes('misma') || mensaje.includes('igual') || mensaje.includes('origen') || mensaje.includes('destino') || mensaje.includes('distint');",
                  "    pm.expect(ok, 'el error debe rechazar transferencia a la misma cuenta').to.be.true;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('No se devuelve id de transferencia creada', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const data = body.data || {};",
                  "    pm.expect(data.id, 'no debe crear transferencia').to.not.be.ok;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response time is less than 3000ms', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(3000);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "utils.assertNoNuevaTransferencia();",
                  "utils.assertSaldosSinCambio(origenId, origenId);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cuentaOrigenId\": {{cuentaOrigenId}},\n  \"cuentaDestinoId\": {{cuentaOrigenId}},\n  \"monto\": {{montoValido}},\n  \"descripcion\": \"Rechazo: misma cuenta origen y destino\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transferencias",
